title: GameOverGeneral
---
<<declare $goNumber = 0>>
<<set $goNumber = random_range(0, 2)>>
<<if $goNumber == 0>>
Not this time… I’ll do better. #line:NotThisTime
<<elseif $goNumber == 1>>
Again. As long as it takes. #line:Again
<<else>>
You’re worth every step through hell. #line:YoureWorth
<<endif>>
